- `px61.mjs` — Home in flow (PX-61, replaces `px55.mjs`): no-JS render, five widths with nothing sticky and no overflow and the statement played to the end, keyboard reach, no page errors; full-page captures to a given folder (`node tools/review/px61.mjs <origin> <outdir>`).
- `seo.mjs` — the SEO audit as a check (PX-59, `pnpm seo:check`, after `pnpm build`): one title and description of sane length per page, one `h1`, canonical = sitemap entry, alt and dimensions on every image, a WebP source wherever `tools/images/derive.mjs` made one, JSON-LD that parses and names the page, share image on disk, image sitemap entries on disk, robots, the 404's `noindex`, no `http://`. Exits 1 on errors; `--json <file>` writes the table.
